{% set cur = ctx.currency %}
## User's financial context
("—" means the value is not available)
- Reference date: {{ ctx.as_of or "—" }}
- Currency: {{ cur }}
- Monthly income: {{ ctx.monthly_income | money(cur) }}
- Payday (day of month): {{ ctx.payday or "—" }}
- Current month: income {{ ctx.month_income | money(cur) }}, expenses {{ ctx.month_expenses | money(cur) }}

### Accounts
{% for a in ctx.accounts %}
- {{ a.name }} ({{ a.type or "no type" }}): {{ a.balance | money(a.currency or cur) }}
{% else %}
- No accounts.
{% endfor %}

### Funds
{% for f in ctx.funds %}
- {{ f.name }}: {{ f.balance | money(cur) }}{% if f.categories %} — categories: {{ f.categories | join(", ") }}{% endif %}

{% else %}
- No funds.
{% endfor %}

### Subscriptions
{% for s in ctx.subscriptions %}
- {{ s.name }}: {{ s.amount | money(cur) }} ({{ s.billing_cycle or "—" }}), next charge {{ s.next_billing_date or "—" }}
{% else %}
- No subscriptions.
{% endfor %}

### Monthly budgets
{% for b in ctx.budgets %}
- {{ b.category }}: spent {{ b.spent | money(cur) }} of {{ b.amount | money(cur) }}
{% else %}
- No budgets.
{% endfor %}

### Goals
{% for g in ctx.goals %}
- {{ g.name }} ({{ g.status or "active" }}): {{ g.current_amount | money(cur) }} of {{ g.target_amount | money(cur) }}, deadline {{ g.deadline or "—" }}
{% else %}
- No goals.
{% endfor %}

### Investments
{% for i in ctx.investments %}
- {{ i.symbol }} ({{ i.type or "—" }}): {{ i.quantity }} units, average price {{ i.average_price | money(i.currency or cur) }}, current price {{ i.current_price | money(i.currency or cur) }}
{% else %}
- No investments.
{% endfor %}

### Recent transactions
{% for t in ctx.recent_transactions %}
- {{ t.date }} · {{ t.type }} · {{ t.amount | money(cur) }} · {{ t.category or "uncategorized" }}{% if t.description %} · {{ t.description }}{% endif %}

{% else %}
- No recent transactions.
{% endfor %}
